cbt.violation.body:
The KBO's opening-day salary snapshot has placed {team_name} above the competitive balance tax threshold for {season}. A winter of roster spending now has an immediate number attached to it.

The club's payroll was listed at {payroll}, against a threshold of {threshold}. That left an overage of {overage}; at {tax_rate_pct}%, the tax due is {tax_amount}.

For {team_name}, this is {consecutive_count} straight over-threshold season(s). That streak now becomes part of every future roster discussion.{draft_penalty_text}

